# #996 T8: what each real-spacing level draws, along the demo journey.
# Each level's cell seen from its edge toward its centre, then from inside.
# The first shot warms the draw pipelines and is not judged.
# name           level  where                       look
zoom-warm        L2     x=0 y=0 z=0.6               dir=0,0,-1
L2-clusters      L2     x=0 y=0 z=0.6               dir=0,0,-1
L3-galaxies      L3     x=0 y=0 z=0.6               dir=0,0,-1
L3-inside        L3     x=0 y=0 z=0.1               dir=0,0,-1
L4-disk          L4     x=0 y=0 z=0.6               dir=0,0,-1
L4-edge          L4     x=0.6 y=0 z=0               dir=-1,0,0
L5-ball          L5     x=0 y=0 z=0.35              dir=0,0,-1
L5-inside        L5     x=0 y=0 z=0.02              dir=0,0,-1
L6-system        L6     x=0 y=0 z=0.3               dir=0,0,-1
